  abilityId: 2851018
  abilityName: Into the Light
  abilityDesc: 34 combo Light attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    12 combo Light attack on single foe (25% active Pierce on Light, Dark foes),
    4 turns spark vulnerability infliction, boosts Atk, Def, Rec relative to max
    HP for 4 turns, boosts spark damage for 4 turns & activates BB/SBB/UBB twice
    for 3 turns
